# .github/CODEOWNERS — Classroom Platform v7
#
# One owning team per feature folder (architecture doc, section 6 "Ownership map").
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so this file goes from general to specific.
# Enforcement: branch protection on main with "Require review from Code Owners".
#
# Teams (replace the organisation slug if yours differs; every team needs write access):
#   @classroom-platform/platform       F7  production and operations, CI/CD, core infrastructure
#   @classroom-platform/security       cross-cutting reviewer for secrets, auth, hardening
#   @classroom-platform/live-classroom F1  SFU, classroom, signalling, recording
#   @classroom-platform/connectivity   F8  ICE, STUN/TURN, SFU public addressing, media regions
#   @classroom-platform/community      F2  spaces, feeds, notifications
#   @classroom-platform/learning       F3  courses, builder, progress, certificates
#   @classroom-platform/media          F4  uploads, transcoding, assignments, storage
#   @classroom-platform/clients        F5  contracts, core-client, web shell, mobile
#   @classroom-platform/messaging      F6  chat, profiles, presence

